      "id": "pf_7b526b17_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "At BLOCH, we’re dedicated to our ongoing commitment to inclusivity and embracing the beauty of diverse complexions. Over the years we’ve introduced a number of complementary skin colored shades into our <a href=\"https://us.blochworld.com/collections/adults-dancewear-leotards \" target=\"_blank\">leotards</a>, half soles, <a href=\"https://us.blochworld.com/collections/adults-dance-shoes-ballet \" target=\"_blank\">ballet flats</a>, Blochsox, foot thongs, <a href=\"https://us.blochworld.com/collections/adults-dancewear-tights \" target=\"_blank\">tights</a> and kneepads, and we’ve been listening to our dance community to develop the exciting introduction of tonal ballet shoes.&nbsp; &nbsp;"
