      "id": "pf_e6b465d6_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Dance is for everyone, and we think pointe shoes should reflect that, which is why we’ve worked with dancers in our community to create tonal pointe shoes to suit a range of skin tones. The BLOCH tonal pointe shoes collection includes our bestselling shoe styles, the Heritage and Balance European, in all our usual sizes. You can also find our professional Stretch Satin Ribbon in all four tonal shades. Each product in the BLOCH tonal pointe shoe range offers the same expert style and quality you can expect from BLOCH pointe shoes – in shades to suit you."
